<title>FRANCE: Moulinex 1996/97 sales down 0.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Moulinex 1996/97 sales down 0.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 7,746    vs    7,788</p>
<p>NOTE - The appliance manufacturer said in a statement sales fell 0.8 percent on a like-for-like basis to 7,694 million francs. Moulinex said the level of sales should allow the group to achieve an operating profit in line with its targets.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
